&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;Account Executive- Ops&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; London, United Kingdom&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt; (2-3 days a week from our London offices)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;You will be the operational backbone of the account. You&#39;ll gather and validate data from a large freelance network, produce accurate reporting and cost estimates, and support the planning of large-scale localisation events. You&#39;ll work independently on day-to-day tasks and partner closely with internal teams, finance, vendors and Client&#39;s events team. Your work helps the account run smoothly, stay compliant with client policy and deliver on time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;A few times a year, client campaigns will require you to work from Client&#39;s London office. We&#39;ll share more detail at interview stage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Data, Financial Management and Reporting&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and validate weekly timesheet data from a large network of freelancers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain reporting templates, adapting them as requirements change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and analyse data for internal and client-facing reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create accurate, timely cost estimates for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Logistics and Coordination&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide logistics and planning support for large-scale localisation events, coordinating between internal teams and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Client&#39;s events team to organise travel and accommodation for attendees, making sure bookings meet current policy, budget and security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Network Operations and Administration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboard new network members, including account creation, access management and troubleshooting support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support financial administration by validating and processing network POs and working with internal finance teams to resolve invoicing queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a point of contact for Client&#39;s vendor accounts, liaising with vendors on event planning and account management, and resolving account or access issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain documentation, floor plans and team databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other day-to-day operational tasks as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
