&lt;li&gt;Experience in an operations, administrative or coordination role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in the Microsoft Office suite, especially Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with internal systems for raising sales orders and estimates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisation and the ability to manage several priorities at once.&lt;/li&gt;
