&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Gen AI tools to improve the quality and efficiency of reporting, documentation and administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building personal AI workflows that save time and improve accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An agentic approach to problem-solving: breaking down tasks and finding efficient, repeatable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
