&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Run campaign plans from briefing to launch, tracking milestones, dependencies and deadlines across multiple campaigns at once. Spot risks early and hold stakeholders accountable for their actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate clearly:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn plans into clear, actionable updates for commercial teams, and build and run merchant communication plans, including email campaigns, sign-up reminders and operational guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Create high-quality sell-in materials such as Google Slides decks, email templates and campaign toolkits. Build landing pages on the Partner Website and make sure all assets are accurate, on-brand and hosted on Seismic ahead of launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong relationships across marketing, commercial and cross-functional teams. Influence them to involve GTM early, challenge timelines constructively and keep everyone aligned through regular check-ins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep improving:&lt;/strong&gt; Support post-launch evaluations and find ways to improve GTM content, processes and how marketing and commercial teams work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Essential&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product marketing experience at a fast-paced company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management, negotiation and influencing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication, able to tailor messaging for different audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple cross-functional projects in parallel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised with strong attention to detail, and comfortable with ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A creative mindset with an eye for design and engaging content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in GTM, commercial or marketing functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with merchant or partner communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building landing pages using a website content management system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Seismic or similar sales enablement platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt; Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt; Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
